# Procura Coding and Agent Rules

When editing this repository, adhere to the following rules:

## 1. Directory Structure
- Keep Python agents isolated inside `agents/<agent_name>/`.
- API endpoints go under `backend/app/api/v1/`.
- Frontend code must reside in `frontend/src/` with structured subfolders (`pages/`, `components/`, `hooks/`, `layouts/`).

## 2. Coding Standards
- **Python**: Use typing declarations, write docstrings for services, and format via PEP 8 standards. Keep database models separated in `backend/app/models/`.
- **TypeScript & React**: Utilize strict type safety. Avoid using `any` types. Maintain components as functional components.

## 3. UI/UX and Aesthetics
- Maintain the premium dark-themed layout across all pages.
- Ensure all interactive elements have functional actions and trigger feedback messages or toasts.
- Verify page layouts fit within standard viewport constraints without clipping important controls.
